					<Description>Unit of the heat capacity (British thermal unit according to the international table according to the Rankine degree) according to the Imperial system of units divided by the unit avoirdupois pound according to the avoirdupois system of units.</Description>
				</Value>
				<Value Code="N65">
					<Title>kilocalorie (international table) per gram kelvin</Title>
